{"name":"Piggy Bank","hex":"#ffccbb","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"piggy bank","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small container, sometimes in the form of a pig, in which small saved coins are stored.","Any supply of money or savings."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/piggy_bank"}],"entries":[{"title":"Piggy bank","blocks":[{"text":"A piggy bank is a coin container normally used by children, featuring a slot at the top to insert coins or folded bank notes. The piggy bank is known to collectors as a \"still bank\" as opposed to the \"mechanical banks\" popular in the early 20th century. These items are also often used by companies for promotional purposes, and many financial service companies use piggy banks as logos for their savings products."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Sparschwein_Haspa02.jpg/330px-Sparschwein_Haspa02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piggy_bank","wikidata":"Q221994"},{"title":"Piggy Bank (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Piggy Bank\" is the fifth track from 50 Cent's second album, The Massacre. It was not released as a single, but charted at eighty-eight on the Billboard Hot 100 due to controversy over its attack on long-time rival Ja Rule, as well as Jadakiss and Fat Joe, who had worked with Ja Rule on his song \"New York\". The song also takes lyrical swipes at rappers Shyne, Kelis, Sheek Louch, Cassidy, Lil' Kim and Nas. He also mentions Tupac Shakur, Jay-Z, Mobb Deep and Michael Jackson in the song, but not negatively."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piggy_Bank_(song)","wikidata":"Q2557520"},{"title":"Bank","blocks":[{"text":"A bank is a financial institution that accepts deposits from the public and creates a demand deposit while making loans. Lending activities can be directly performed by the bank or indirectly through capital markets."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/London.bankofengland.arp.jpg/330px-London.bankofengland.arp.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bank","wikidata":"Q22687"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Earthen_pot_02.jpg/500px-Earthen_pot_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Earthen_pot_02.jpg/1280px-Earthen_pot_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Earthen_pot_02.jpg/500px-Earthen_pot_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Earthen pots used in Nepal as piggy banks.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEarthen_pot_02.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Hellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensammlung_Berlin.jpg/500px-Hellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensammlung_Berlin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Hellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensammlung_Berlin.jpg/1280px-Hellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensammlung_Berlin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Hellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensammlung_Berlin.jpg/500px-Hellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensammlung_Berlin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An ancient Greek money box from Priene, 2nd century BC.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHellenistic_Money_box_in_shape_of_a_temple_from_Priene_Antikensamm